  "term": "cosmic consciousness",
  "definition": "In this historical source, cosmic consciousness means a conception of the Absolute as a single all-embracing consciousness that includes human, animal, and any other minds as parts. It is described as a unified experience that transcends time by holding all streams of temporal experience together in one consciousness.",
